# Release build output. Older builds wrote UP-<CODE>/ and UP-<CODE>.<FORMAT>
# into the repo root before the output root moved to ~/Documents/Up Rough
# Releases/; a leftover UP-<CODE> is also what assertLocalCodeAvailable
# refuses to build over.
UP-*/
UP-*.LHA
UP-*.ZIP
UP-*.lha
UP-*.zip
